{"id":4879,"date":"2024-12-06T10:42:45","date_gmt":"2024-12-06T02:42:45","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?p=4879"},"modified":"2025-01-26T22:37:17","modified_gmt":"2025-01-26T14:37:17","slug":"baghouse-filter-bags","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?p=4879","title":{"rendered":"Baghouse Filter Bags"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4879\" class=\"elementor elementor-4879\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb8f1c5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"cb8f1c5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-440ae02 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"440ae02\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d36353 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4d36353\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-750x450-p1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4880\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-750x450-p1.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-750x450-p1-300x180.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-750x450-p1-600x360.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2682507 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2682507\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Baghouse filter bags are important components used in dust removal equipment. These filter bags are usually made of high temperature and corrosion resistant materials such as polyester fiber, polypropylene fiber or fiberglass. Their main function is to capture particulate matter in the air, such as dust, particles, smoke, etc., thereby improving air quality and protecting the environment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95d955b e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"95d955b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-09c008e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"09c008e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The working principle<\/h2><p>The working principle of the baghouse filter bags is to pass the gas containing particulate matter into the dust collector, and then capture the particulate matter through surface or deep filtration of the filter bag. Generally speaking, particulate matter will be trapped on the surface of the filter bag or on the filter media inside the filter bag when the air flows through the filter bag, while the clean gas is released through the filter bag.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33844e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"33844e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-Filter-Bag-p3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4883\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-Filter-Bag-p3.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-Filter-Bag-p3-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-Filter-Bag-p3-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Baghouse-Filter-Bag-p3-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e97b225 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e97b225\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This type of filter bag is widely used in various industrial fields, such as cement production, steel smelting, chemical industry, etc., as well as in some specific applications, such as air purifiers in medical equipment. Choosing the appropriate filter bag material and design is crucial to improving dust removal efficiency and stable operation of the equipment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f91689 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5f91689\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d37548 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2d37548\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Homopolymer-Acrylic-p4_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4886\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Homopolymer-Acrylic-p4_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Homopolymer-Acrylic-p4_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Homopolymer-Acrylic-p4_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Homopolymer-Acrylic-p4_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6e580e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6e580e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ab0dc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5ab0dc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Acrylic Filter Bags<\/h2><p>Acrylic Filter Bag has good anti-chemical and anti-hydrolysis performances in\u00a0filter bag family. It is widely used in the detergent, waste incinerators, asphalt, dance spray dryer, coal mill and power plant for dust collection.<\/p><p>The main advantages and features:<\/p><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>To increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collectors ;<\/li><li>System cleaning efficiency markedly increased with the effective increase of bag to bag distance;<\/li><li>Bag life extended due to significant reduction of fatigue damage to the bags due to bag to cage impact.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0da9f85 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"0da9f85\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=acrylic-filter-bags\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">MORE<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5034d8b e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5034d8b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44d8802 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"44d8802\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Nomex-Aramid-Filter-Bag-p5_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4890\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Nomex-Aramid-Filter-Bag-p5_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Nomex-Aramid-Filter-Bag-p5_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Nomex-Aramid-Filter-Bag-p5_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Nomex-Aramid-Filter-Bag-p5_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3815c05 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3815c05\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-39e1448 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"39e1448\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Aramid Filter Bags<\/h2><p>Aramid, also known as Nomex\u00a9, is widely used in high-temperature applications because of its excellent resistance to abrasion and ability to perform at maximum continuous operating temperatures of 204\u00b0C. The aramid filter bag is a high-temperature filter bag used in pulse jet baghouse dust collectors. Compared with the other heat-resisting fabrics, Aramid is cheaper and better. Good performances of intensity. Good abrasion and folding resistance. The acid resistance of our Aramid Filter Bag is good.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b75fcd6 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"b75fcd6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=nomex-filter-bags\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">MORE<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-37af399 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"37af399\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db347b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"db347b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/FMS-Filter-Bag-p6_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4892\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/FMS-Filter-Bag-p6_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/FMS-Filter-Bag-p6_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/FMS-Filter-Bag-p6_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/FMS-Filter-Bag-p6_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-584a256 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"584a256\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82e2740 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"82e2740\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FMS Filter Bags<\/h2><p>FMS (Flumes) filter bag is one of the most common used filter bags, which has high temperature resistance. It is generally considered an environmentally friendly and cost-effective filtration solution because they effectively capture contaminants, reduce environmental impact, and extend the life of equipment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-723e0f5 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"723e0f5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=fms-filter-bags\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">MORE<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0bad6c e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f0bad6c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d4c52b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d4c52b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Fiberglass-Blanded-p7_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4893\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Fiberglass-Blanded-p7_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Fiberglass-Blanded-p7_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Fiberglass-Blanded-p7_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-Fiberglass-Blanded-p7_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12cd3e6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"12cd3e6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3b45e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e3b45e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fiberglass Filter Bags<\/h2><p>The fiberglass is an inorganic fiber whose main component is SiO2. It is obtained by melting the glass frit at a temperature of 1300-1600 \u00b0 C, drawing filaments from the molten state and rapidly quenching. There are two kinds of filter materials: C glass (medium-alkali glass or soda calcium silicate glass) and E glass (alkali-free glass or aluminoborosilicate glass). The most advantages of fiberglass is high temperature resistance, good dimensional stability, and high tensile breaking strength. In terms of chemical corrosion resistance, glass fiber is stable to other media except hydrofluoric acid and high temperature and strong alkali.\u00a0 The fiberglass filter bag is resistant to high temperature, abrasion, water and oil.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd00427 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"cd00427\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=fiberglass-filter-bags\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">MORE<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bbb9ab6 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bbb9ab6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-927a07d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"927a07d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bag-p8_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4894\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bag-p8_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bag-p8_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bag-p8_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bag-p8_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68edd88 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"68edd88\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40b1cf7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"40b1cf7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Polyester Filter Bags<\/h2><p>Polyester filter bag is the most common materials in the filter bag family. Polyester needle felt filter bags are made of needle punched many times and properly rolled. The short fibers are laid into a fiber web, and then the fiber web is reinforced into a cloth by needles with barbs, and the fiber web is repeatedly punctured to reinforce the fibers to form a needle-punched non-woven fabric. Non-woven fabrics have no distinction between warp and weft, the fibers are messy, and there is little difference in radial and weft properties. The air permeability of the polyester filter bag is more than 50% higher than that of the ordinary calendered filter material, the surface is smooth, the air permeability is good, and the resistance is low. The dust on the surface of the polyester filter bag is easy to fall off, which prolongs the dust removal cycle and service life of the filter bag.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9c005a elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"f9c005a\" data-e